{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Playwright-style auto-waiting interaction: waits for the target to be attached, visible, enabled (and bounding-box stable for click/check/uncheck), then dispatches in the same synchronous task. Actions: click, fill (native setter, React-safe), type (per-char key events), press (Enter/Tab/Escape/arrows; Enter requestSubmits), select (by value/label/text), check, uncheck. Selector engine beyond CSS: text=, css=, :visible, :nth-match(n), and >> chaining (e.g. \"form >> text=Save\"). arg carries the value for fill/type, the key for press, the option for select; pass \"\" when unused. timeout_ms<=0 defaults to 10000. Returns {status, action, selector, desc, bbox, attempts, elapsed_ms, selected?/typed?/already?} or {status:err, msg, state(absent|hidden|disabled|stabilizing|no-option)}.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;","params":[{"name":"action","type":"String"},{"name":"selector","type":"String"},{"name":"arg","type":"String"},{"name":"timeout_ms","type":"Integer"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"mqgnnp1a10bcf38a1j18d","readers":[],"time":1791202252762,"username":"system","writers":[]}